{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinobi Smoke is stepping out of the driver\u2019s seat and into the shadows with the latest Crime Boss: Rockay City character pack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Shinobi Smoke and take matters into your own hands with new weapons, equipment, and unique perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Loadout</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tPrimary Weapon: Crossbow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tSecondary Weapon: Glizzy ES+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tMelee Weapon: Ninjat\u014d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tEquipment: Smoke Bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique perks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tRazor Focus - Upgrades any sword, increasing its lethality, range, and unlocking unique abilities across three tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\tRebound - Trades maximum HP for accelerated health regeneration and shorter regen delay. Boosts mobility and sliding with reduced fall damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All versions of Smoke\u2019s boss appearance will be playable in co-op modes, and his new loadout will carry over to the roguelite campaign. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916000?t=1758034725","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916000/023d1f091a48e683df1c2b97e86c1ded59a2ead3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758034725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916000/bc484bcfdf4a7851e71198822cdc22f148c8f465/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758034725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916000/bc484bcfdf4a7851e71198822cdc22f148c8f465/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758034725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"desc